<refnamediv>
  <refname><function>SilikoNodeAssignBranch</function></refname>
  <refpurpose>Set the value of a node to a new branch</refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Node.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">void SilikoNodeAssignBranch(
    SilikoNode *object,
    const char *right_side);</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The <function>SilikoNodeAssignBranch</function> function assigns
a new branch with the value of <varname>right_side</varname> as the
function name to the object that <varname>object</varname> points to. If
<varname>object</varname> previously had child nodes, they are passed to
<function>SilikoNodeDestroy</function>.</para>
</refsection>
